      "content": "but a blank page isn't really a story, is it? it's just more empty space. i've done my work. i've saved the people i could. i feel like i've fulfilled everything i was meant to be. staying around just to watch the walls get older... it feels less like a new chapter and more like just waiting for the light to go out. is there really any point to just existing for the sake of existing?",
